@baseUrl = http://localhost:5072
@ownerToken = demo-owner-token
@guestToken = demo-guest-token

### Level 1: group snapshot, all sessions and totals
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/groups/group-123/sessions
X-Demo-Token: {{ownerToken}}

### Level 2: owner session id
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/reservation-123/guest-session-id
X-Demo-Token: {{ownerToken}}

### Level 2: submit ONLY submitted sessions
POST {{baseUrl}}/group-reservations/group-123/submit
X-Demo-Token: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservationId": "reservation-123"
}

### Level 3: delete the unsubmitted guest Marta and recalculate totals
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/guest/groups/group-123/sessions/session3
X-Demo-Token: {{ownerToken}}

### Security: Guest gets 403 instead of the Owner response
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/groups/group-123/sessions
X-Demo-Token: {{guestToken}}

### Security: Missing token gets 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/groups/group-123/sessions

### Missing reservation -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/does-not-exist/guest-session-id
X-Demo-Token: {{ownerToken}}

### Wrong reservation in submit -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/group-reservations/group-123/submit
X-Demo-Token: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservationId": "wrong-reservation"
}

### Owner session cannot be deleted -> 400
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/guest/groups/group-123/sessions/owner-session-123
X-Demo-Token: {{ownerToken}}
